A small Lamlet document. Everything outside dollar regions is prose.

$[Import* std]
$[# square {^ {x} {* x x}}]
$[# AGE [% 21]]

The square of 6 is ${square 6}. I am $[% AGE] years old, so I am
${!if {>= AGE 21} "eligible" "not eligible"} to vote in this example.

$[# counter {. count 3 label "items"}]
There are ${.count counter} ${.label counter}.

$[# nums [% {map {' 1 2 3} {^ {x} {+ x 1}}}]]
${!assert nums {' 2 3 4}}
$[f "The total is ${fold nums 0 +}."]
